  &lt;string name="HARM_DRAG_HINT"&gt;Drag it onto the target: an NPC takes Wounds, a PC must Endure Injury.&lt;/string&gt;
  &lt;string name="HARM_NPC"&gt;%s: %d Wounds (Harm %d − armor %d)&lt;/string&gt;
  &lt;string name="HARM_NPC_MOVE"&gt;The GM makes a harm move.&lt;/string&gt;
  &lt;string name="HARM_NPC_DEAD"&gt;All Wounds marked: the NPC dies.&lt;/string&gt;
